{"text":"太和廿年，步輦郎張元祖不幸喪亡，妻一弗爲造像一區。願令亡夫直生佛國。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"張元祖","refId":null,"text":"張元祖","start":8,"end":11},{"name":"PersonName","term":"一弗","refId":null,"text":"一弗","start":17,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"佛國","refId":null,"text":"佛國","start":31,"end":33}]}